WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.800
Pick a game from the cards. Every puzzle is made new for you, with one answer you can reach by logic alone.

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:22.700
Read a brand new story, then use the clues to fill the grid and close the case.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:34.600
1 to 9 in every row, column and box. Play Classic, or four new games: Rival Grid, Chain Reaction, Tidewater and Glyph Quest.

4
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:45.500
Fill each cage so its numbers make the target, with every number once in each row and column.

5
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:56.400
A crossword of numbers: every run adds up to its clue, with no number twice.

6
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:09.300
Shade what the row and column numbers call for, and a picture appears for your gallery.
